                        "sense_id": "11bed2bb-876d-36b6-a794-d0710121369a",
                        "entry_id": "bab84996-ac11-3be3-9975-68cacaf35a26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a manner that is unfair."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5a5aa81-bf05-4f81-bc9f-12ae9359327b",
                                "sense_id": "11bed2bb-876d-36b6-a794-d0710121369a",
                                "text": "The carnival games were unfairly difficult, and hardly anybody won a prize."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfe8bb76-a47f-4de5-9f2b-928851331794",
                                "sense_id": "11bed2bb-876d-36b6-a794-d0710121369a",
                                "text": "As a result, many Black people remained unfairly enslaved and indentured in the so-called free territory. This was not legal slavery (also known as de jure slavery), but slavery in practice (de facto slavery)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
